+// ── History mirror ──
+//
+// When the pane's history lives on a server, the live terminal holds only the
+// repaint diffs of its screen. The mirror is a second terminal that keeps the
+// live screen plus real scrollback: when the live screen's rows move up, the
+// rows that left its top are pushed into the mirror's scrollback, so the view
+// can scroll and fling through them with no round trip.
